[en.IDEA_C12_APPLES_FROM_SAME_TREE]
Apples from the Same Tree

[en.IDEA_C12_APPLES_FROM_SAME_TREE_desc]
While it’s not clear how close the Apple family and the Pie family are by blood, the bond between the two extended families is enough to ward off any chill wind.
Just like Applejack and Pinkie Pie in the old days:
§g“Of course! We might be related!”§!
“Hey! I was gonna say that!”
§g“Stop saying what I’m saying!”§!
“You stop it first!”

[en.IDEA_C12_APPLES_FROM_SAME_TREE_TOOLTIP]
The current level of relationship between the two families: §HNormal§!

[en.IDEA_C12_APPLES_FROM_SAME_TREE_DOWNGRADE_TOOLTIP]
Downgrade the relationship between the Pie family and the Apple family to: §HNormal§!

[zh.IDEA_C12_APPLES_FROM_SAME_TREE]
驱寒暖风

[zh.IDEA_C12_APPLES_FROM_SAME_TREE_desc]
虽然不清楚苹果家族和派家族血缘关系有多么亲近，但是这两个大家族之间的情谊足以驱散任何寒风。
正如当年的苹果嘉儿和萍琪派：
§g“当然了！我们可能是亲戚嘛！”§!
“嘿！那是我想说的！”
§g“停下，别学我说话！”§!
“你先停下！”

[zh.IDEA_C12_APPLES_FROM_SAME_TREE_TOOLTIP]
当前派家族与苹果家族关系：§H正常§!

[zh.IDEA_C12_APPLES_FROM_SAME_TREE_DOWNGRADE_TOOLTIP]
将派家族与苹果家族关系降级至：§H正常§!
